    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_pretty_stack_trace_entry" kindref="compound">PrettyStackTraceEntry</ref> - This class is used to represent a frame of the &quot;pretty&quot; stack trace that is dumped when a program crashes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>You can define subclasses of this and declare them on the program stack: when they are constructed and destructed, they will add their symbolic frames to a virtual stack trace. This gets dumped out if the program crashes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
